# Docker reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` for this Dockerfile, which is what
# lets the build context be the repository root while the file lives beside the
# Dockerfile. The root context is required: `bun install --frozen-lockfile`
# needs `bun.lock` and every workspace manifest, and Bun's isolated linker puts
# the server's dependencies in `apps/server/node_modules`.
#
# Everything else is excluded, so editing a client module or running the test
# suite on the host cannot invalidate the install layer.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.wrangler
**/.playwright-cli
**/*.log
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx

.git
.gitignore
.conductor
conductor
artifacts
docs
scripts
*.png

# Only each workspace's manifest is needed; its sources are not.
apps/client/**
!apps/client/package.json
packages/sim/**
!packages/sim/package.json
packages/voxel/**
!packages/voxel/package.json
